        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LOG100SLVSS4, 1 Inch Wood Door Pull with Stainless Steel Sleeves and Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid wood, this contemporary pull is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. You can choose your favorite <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\">type of wood</a> because the Wooden 1 Inch Door Handle with Stainless Steel End Caps can be made with any of the different types. The Logan 1 Inch Wood Door Pull  can be finished with either satin or polished stainless steel  mounts and end cap sleeves. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n<br>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/contemporary-1-1-2-inch-wooden-door-handle-with-stainless-steel-end-caps-first-impressions-log150sl\"><b>1-1/2 Inch Wooden Door Handle with Stainless Steel End Caps</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions LOG100SLVSS4 Logan Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Pull End Cap Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LGN07-specifications.pdf?v=1704262337\"><b>First Impressions LOG100SLVSS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LOG100012SLVSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Sleeve Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LOG100024SLVSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Sleeve Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LOG100036SLVSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 27\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Sleeve Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
